{"uid":"6f1cc2b3146580b","name":"test_header_flag_beats_template_beats_profile_step_by_step","fullName":"tests.test_llm_header_visibility#test_header_flag_beats_template_beats_profile_step_by_step","historyId":"24fbeb694bdf5fdae4f5bd2ddde0828f","time":{"start":1791925632714,"stop":1791925633886,"duration":1172},"description":"Task 013 (#14, PRD requirement D.4): the FULL precedence chain for\n    ONE header name (`X-Source`), measured layer by layer so a reversed\n    template/profile order cannot hide behind the flag's own win.\n\n    Three real `start` launches against the same profile:\n\n    1. profile only (no template, no flag)      -> `profile`\n    2. profile + template (still no flag)       -> `template`  (tpl > prof)\n    3. profile + template + `--llm-header`      -> `flag`      (flag > tpl)\n\n    Step 2 is what the previous take was missing INSIDE a single named\n    node: launching once with all three layers present and asserting only\n    the final `flag` value passes just as happily on a tree where the\n    profile beats the template, because the flag masks both. Each step\n    below asserts the container's own `pi/models.json` (what is actually\n    effective) AND the `llm-wiring.json` display/persistence map (task\n    010's addition), so a divergence between the two is caught too.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Task 013 (#14, PRD requirement D.4): the FULL precedence chain for<br />\nONE header name (<code>X-Source</code>), measured layer by layer so a reversed<br />\ntemplate/profile order cannot hide behind the flag's own win.</p>\n<pre><code>Three real `start` launches against the same profile:\n\n1. profile only (no template, no flag)      -&gt; `profile`\n2. profile + template (still no flag)       -&gt; `template`  (tpl &gt; prof)\n3. profile + template + `--llm-header`      -&gt; `flag`      (flag &gt; tpl)\n\nStep 2 is what the previous take was missing INSIDE a single named\nnode: launching once with all three layers present and asserting only\nthe final `flag` value passes just as happily on a tree where the\nprofile beats the template, because the flag masks both. Each step\nbelow asserts the container's own `pi/models.json` (what is actually\neffective) AND the `llm-wiring.json` display/persistence map (task\n010's addition), so a divergence between the two is caught too.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1791925216481,"stop":1791925216481,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1791925216482,"stop":1791925216482,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_home_in_process","time":{"start":1791925632675,"stop":1791925632686,"duration":11},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1791925632675,"stop":1791925632675,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_scrub_notifier_env_in_process","time":{"start":1791925632686,"stop":1791925632697,"duration":11},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_isolate_ambient_task_record_dir","time":{"start":1791925632686,"stop":1791925632686,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"